{"lyrics":"[00:00.16](Lil' Mexico, Yeah, Ayy, Yo', Mexico, Uh-Huh)\n[00:03.90]Uh-huh, yeah, I go so hard, goddamn\n[00:09.50]Motion\n[00:11.36]I go so hard (Haha), I go so hard (Haha)\n[00:13.76]I'm a rockstar, my brother with that stick talk (That stick)\n[00:17.20]We don't say shit at all, we don't like that shit talk (Tch-tch-tch)\n[00:20.14]Ain't no off days at all, but we get them bricks off (Brick-brick)\n[00:23.26]I sip Wockhardt (Lean), with the moonrock (Skrrt)\n[00:26.00]In that Bentley truck (Uh), yes I feel exotic (Skrrt, yeah)\n[00:28.74]Your shit ain't there yet (Yeah), put some drip on it (Yeah)\n[00:31.74]I'll take your whole check (Yeah), and then I shit on it\n[00:34.78]Rollie white as fuck, like I just put a brick on it (What else?)\n[00:37.54]Your Rollie fake as fuck, boy you can hear the tick on it (Phew)\n[00:40.46]The way she suck me up, I thought it was a tick on me (Ooh)\n[00:43.54]I get the money, then I split it with my big homies (Ooh)\n[00:46.30]You show your man off, that nigga ain't got shit on me (Ooh)\n[00:49.22]My clothing like my state of mind, I got Revenge on me (Ooh)\n[00:52.50]F&N on me (Phew), that's a sick homie (Phew)\n[00:55.08]Not big enough, my shit will smoke you like a cig homie\n[00:58.04]I bought a couple Gucci coats, 'cause it's a cold world (Yeah)\n[01:01.02]I dropped the pill in the lean, watch it fizz on me\n[01:04.06]Ain't enough love for me in the whole world\n[01:06.94]My apologies, my heart be getting big on me\n[01:09.94]I go so hard (Haha), I go so hard (Haha)\n[01:12.30]I'm a rockstar, my brother with that stick talk (That stick)\n[01:15.74]We don't say shit at all, we don't like that shit talk (Tch-tch-tch)\n[01:18.70]Ain't no off days at all, but we get them bricks off (Brick-brick)\n[01:21.80]I sip Wockhardt (Lean), with the moonrock (Skrrt)\n[01:24.54]In that Bentley truck (Uh), yes I feel exotic (Skrrt, yeah)\n[01:27.28]Your shit ain't there yet (Yeah), put some drip on it (Yeah)\n[01:30.28]I'll take your whole check (Yeah), and then I shit on it\n[01:33.26]Sip so much, everybody think that I'm gon' die on it\n[01:36.14]I put my heart into this shit like I just cried on it\n[01:38.98]My brother flippin' in his grave, there's niggas lyin' on him, ayy\n[01:42.66]His homies wasn't ever my homies, ayy\n[01:45.38]Niggas get to shootin' like they Prigioni, uh\n[01:47.98]I get lean straight from Houston, that's the Whitney on me\n[01:50.66]You see that bag 'round my neck, that's the semi on me (Yeah)\n[01:53.64]If I got a backpack it's probably cause it's a titty on it (Yeah)\n[01:56.76]I spent ten racks all on shoes, hella kicks on me\n[01:59.58]It make me feel some type of way, like my name Rich Homie\n[02:02.56]New Balenciaga's on me, I bought two pairs\n[02:05.48]They ain't runners but you niggas know I'm still runnin', ya' dig?\n[02:08.62]I go so hard (Haha), I go so hard (Haha)\n[02:11.50]I'm a rockstar, my brother with that stick talk (That stick)\n[02:14.26]We don't say shit at all, we don't like that shit talk (Tch-tch-tch)\n[02:17.24]Ain't no off days at all, but we get them bricks off (Brick-brick)\n[02:20.20]I sip Wockhardt (Lean), with the moonrock (Skrrt)\n[02:23.08]In that Bentley truck (Uh), yes I feel exotic (Skrrt, yeah)\n[02:25.80]Your shit ain't there yet (Yeah), put some drip on it (Yeah)\n[02:28.82]I'll take your whole check (Yeah), and then I shit on it","words":[[0.16,0.24,"(Lil'"],[0.28,0.56,"Mexico,"],[1.12,1.36,"Yeah,"],[1.68,1.74,"Ayy,"],[1.78,1.84,"Yo',"],[1.88,2.16,"Mexico,"],[2.2,3.86,"Uh-Huh)"],[3.9,4.6,"Uh-huh,"],[4.72,5.52,"yeah,"],[5.56,5.56,"I"],[5.6,5.64,"go"],[5.82,5.92,"so"],[6.94,8.34,"hard,"],[8.38,8.94,"goddamn"],[9.5,10.04,"Motion"],[11.36,11.36,"I"],[11.44,11.5,"go"],[11.68,11.78,"so"],[11.9,11.96,"hard"],[12.0,12.84,"(Haha),"],[12.9,12.9,"I"],[12.94,13.0,"go"],[13.16,13.24,"so"],[13.34,13.4,"hard"],[13.48,13.7,"(Haha)"],[13.76,14.4,"I'm"],[14.46,14.46,"a"],[14.62,15.08,"rockstar,"],[15.14,15.24,"my"],[15.34,15.6,"brother"],[1